{
 "esm": "1.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "SlabLandSurface",
  "description": "WRF's 5-layer slab (thermal diffusion) land-surface scheme, SUBROUTINE SLAB1D of phys/module_sf_slab.F (sf_surface_physics = 1), written as instantaneous tendencies. Surface energy balance: net radiation gsw + emiss (glw - sigma tsk^4), sensible and latent heat fluxes from consumer-supplied bulk exchange coefficients (the surface-layer scheme's FLHC, FLQC), the latent flux driven by the saturation deficit at the skin temperature, and the residual G = rnet - (hfx + lh) conducted into the soil. Soil: the heat equation capg dT/dt = d/dz( capg difsl dT/dz ) on a column of NLEV prognostic layers, written as the flux-form operator D(K_soil D(T_s) - F_soil) and lowered by the EarthSciDiscretizations column_nonuniform_1d rule varcoeff_face_flux_laplacian_lev, with the surface heat flux G entering through the prescribed interface flux F_soil[1] and the deepest WRF soil layer -- which SLAB1D never updates -- acting as a fixed reservoir at temperature T_deep and depth z_deep that closes the bottom boundary through F_soil[NLEV+1]. Orientation: `lev` is the soil layer index with layer 1 at the surface and `ze` the interface DEPTH below ground (positive downward, ze[1] = 0, increasing with the index, the grid's required orientation); the grid-derived zc reproduce WRF's ZS and dz its DZS, and the lowered stencil is exactly SLAB1D's FLUX(L+1) = -DIFSL CAPG (T(L+1)-T(L))/(ZS(L+1)-ZS(L)), DTSDT = -(FLUX(L+1)-FLUX(L))/(DZS(L) CAPG). NLEV = num_soil_layers - 1 (4 for WRF's default 5 layers). The skin temperature follows layer 1: SLAB1D advances TSK by the layer-1 tendency (DTHGDT), so dTsk_dt = dTs_dt[1]; the surface fluxes themselves are evaluated at the consumer-supplied tsk. Water points (xland >= 1.5) are frozen (tendencies multiplied by the land indicator). Not expressible as a rate and therefore reported as the indicator snow_cap_active only: with IFSNOW = 1 SLAB1D caps the layer-1 and skin temperatures at 273.16 K wherever snow covers the ground, a projection of the state applied after each step. The one-layer force-restore form (num_soil_layers = 1: dTg/dt = (rnet - qs)/capg - hm) is not transcribed; hm is computed as WRF does but does not enter the multi-layer tendency. Consumer-supplied column fields (ze, T_s) are rewrite-target ops `input_<name>` lowered by the consumer, in the inline tests through per-test expression_template_imports libraries generated by tools/fill_tests.py (esm-spec 6.6 parameter_overrides admit scalars only).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": ["wrf", "land-surface", "slab", "soil-heat-diffusion", "surface-energy-balance", "column"],
  "references": [
   {"citation": "Dudhia, J. (1996). A multi-layer soil temperature model for MM5. Preprints, 6th PSU/NCAR Mesoscale Model Users' Workshop, Boulder, CO, 49-50."},
   {"citation": "Blackadar, A. K. (1978). Modeling pollutant transfer during daytime convection. Preprints, 4th Symp. on Atmospheric Turbulence, Diffusion and Air Quality, Reno, NV, AMS, 443-447."},
   {"citation": "wrf-model/WRF v4.8.0 phys/module_sf_slab.F, SUBROUTINE SLAB1D lines 232-562 (instrumented in ctessum-claude/WRF branch earthsciml-instrumented, commit e42a269)."}
  ]
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "NLEV": {"type": "integer", "default": 4,
   "description": "Number of prognostic soil layers, WRF num_soil_layers - 1 (the deepest WRF layer is the fixed reservoir T_deep). Bound into the column grid at the import edge."}
 },
 "models": {
  "SlabLandSurface": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "../../../../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/grid.esm", "bindings": {"NLEV": "NLEV"}},
    {"ref": "../../../../EarthSciDiscretizations/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/varcoeff_face_flux_laplacian_lev.esm", "bindings": {"NLEV": "NLEV"}},
    {"ref": "../../../lib/wrf_thermo.esm"},
    {"ref": "./slab_templates.esm"}
   ],
   "subsystems": {
    "wrf": {"ref": "../../../lib/wrf_constants.esm"},
    "par": {"ref": "./slab_parameters.esm"}
   },
   "variables": {
    "t_air": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 285.0, "description": "Temperature of the lowest model layer (WRF T3D(:,1,:), T1D)."},
    "qv_air": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "default": 0.005, "description": "Water-vapor mixing ratio of the lowest model layer (QV1D)."},
    "p_air": {"type": "parameter", "units": "Pa", "default": 97000.0, "description": "Pressure of the lowest model layer (P1D)."},
    "psfc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "Pa", "default": 97300.0, "description": "Surface pressure (PSFCPA)."},
    "flhc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/(m^2*K)", "default": 40.0, "description": "Bulk exchange coefficient for heat from the surface-layer scheme, already multiplied by rho cp |U| (FLHC), so that hfx = flhc (theta_g - theta_air)."},
    "flqc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/(m^2*s)", "default": 0.01, "description": "Bulk exchange coefficient for moisture from the surface-layer scheme, already multiplied by rho |U| and the moisture availability (FLQC), so that qfx = flqc (qsat_g - qv_air)."},
    "tsk": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 286.0, "description": "Skin (ground surface) temperature at which the surface fluxes are evaluated (TSK = TG0)."},
    "gsw": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 300.0, "description": "Net downward shortwave flux at the ground, albedo already applied (GSW)."},
    "glw": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 280.0, "description": "Downward longwave flux at the ground (GLW)."},
    "tmn": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 288.0, "description": "Deep-soil (annual mean) temperature TMN; enters only the force-restore term hm."},
    "thc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "cal/(cm*K*s^0.5)", "default": 0.04, "description": "Soil thermal inertia THC (WRF land-use table, cal cm^-1 K^-1 s^-1/2)."},
    "emiss": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.92, "description": "Surface emissivity EMISS."},
    "mavail": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.6, "description": "Surface moisture availability MAVAIL; SLAB1D only copies it to chklowq (it is already inside flqc)."},
    "xland": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.0, "description": "Land mask XLAND, 1 land, 2 water."},
    "snowc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "Snow-cover flag SNOWC (1 where snow covers the ground)."},
    "radiation": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.0, "description": "1 when a radiation scheme is active (WRF logical `radiation`, RADSWTCH): without radiation SLAB1D drops the upward longwave emission."},
    "ifsnow": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.0, "description": "Namelist IFSNOW: 1 activates the snow-cover temperature cap."},
    "T_deep": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 288.0, "description": "Temperature of the deepest WRF soil layer (TSLB(num_soil_layers)), never updated by SLAB1D and therefore the fixed reservoir closing the soil column at the bottom."},
    "z_deep": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 0.23, "description": "Depth of the centre of the deepest WRF soil layer (ZS(num_soil_layers))."},
    "ze": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "shape": ["lev_nodes"], "description": "Interface depths below ground, ze[1] = 0, ze[k+1] = ze[k] + DZS(k), consumer-supplied through `input_ze`; the grid's single geometry input."},
    "zc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Layer-centre depths (WRF ZS), grid-derived from ze."},
    "dz": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Layer thicknesses (WRF DZS), grid-derived from ze; the finite-volume measure read by the rule."},
    "T_s": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Soil temperature of the prognostic layers (WRF TSLB(1:num_soil_layers-1)), consumer-supplied through `input_T_s`."},
    "land": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Land indicator XLD1: 1 where xland < 1.5, else 0; water points keep their temperatures."},
    "capg": {"type": "unknown", "units": "J/(K*m^3)", "description": "Volumetric soil heat capacity CAPG = 5.9114e7 THC of the multi-layer soil."},
    "exner_air": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Exner function of the lowest model layer, (p_air / p1000mb)^(r_d/cp) (1/THCON)."},
    "theta_air": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "Potential temperature of the lowest model layer (THX)."},
    "exner_sfc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Exner function at the surface pressure."},
    "theta_g": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "Potential temperature of the ground surface, tsk / exner_sfc (THG)."},
    "upflux": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Upward black-body emission of the ground, radiation sigma tsk^4 (UPFLUX)."},
    "xinet": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Net longwave absorbed, emiss (glw - upflux) (XINET)."},
    "rnet": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Net radiation absorbed by the surface, gsw + xinet (RNET)."},
    "hm": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K/s", "description": "Force-restore restoring rate 1.18 eomeg (tsk - tmn) of the one-layer scheme (HM); diagnosed but not applied in the multi-layer form."},
    "psfc_kpa": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kPa", "description": "Surface pressure in kPa, the unit of the Bolton constant svp1 (PSFC = PSFCPA/1000)."},
    "es_g": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kPa", "description": "Saturation vapor pressure at the skin temperature (ESG)."},
    "qsat_g": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "Saturation mixing ratio at the skin temperature and surface pressure, ep_2 es_g / (psfc - es_g) (QSG)."},
    "hfx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Upward sensible heat flux flhc (theta_g - theta_air) (HFX)."},
    "qfx": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/(m^2*s)", "description": "Upward moisture flux flqc (qsat_g - qv_air) (QFX)."},
    "lh": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Latent heat flux xlv qfx (LH)."},
    "qs": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Total turbulent enthalpy flux leaving the surface, hfx + lh (QS)."},
    "G_sfc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "Heat flux conducted into the soil at the surface, rnet - qs, positive downward (FLUX(1))."},
    "K_soil": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/(m*K)", "shape": ["lev_nodes"], "description": "Soil thermal conductivity capg difsl on the interfaces, the coefficient handed to the diffusion rule."},
    "F_soil": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "shape": ["lev_nodes"], "description": "Prescribed part of the interface flux in the rule's K dT/dz - F convention (depth coordinate): G_sfc on the surface interface, the conductive flux to the fixed reservoir, K_soil (T_s[NLEV] - T_deep)/(z_deep - zc[NLEV]), on the bottom interface, 0 on the interior interfaces (where the rule computes the conductive flux itself)."},
    "dTs_dt": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Soil temperature tendency of the prognostic layers, land (1/capg) d/dz(K_soil dT_s/dz - F_soil) (SLAB1D DTSDT, exact in the limit dt -> 0 where the sub-step count nsoil is 1)."},
    "dTsk_dt": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K/s", "description": "Skin temperature tendency, equal to the layer-1 soil tendency (SLAB1D DTHGDT with nsoil = 1)."},
    "qsfc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "Surface mixing ratio handed to the PBL scheme, qv_air + qfx/flqc (= qsat_g when flqc is nonzero) (QSFC)."},
    "chklowq": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "Moisture availability passed through for the PBL scheme, CHKLOWQ = MAVAIL."},
    "snow_cap_active": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "1 when SLAB1D's snow-cover cap would act (ifsnow = 1, snowc > 0 and T_s[1] > 273.16 K): the cap resets the layer-1 and skin temperatures to 273.16 K after the step, a state projection that has no rate form."}
   },
   "equations": [
    {"lhs": "ze", "rhs": {"op": "input_ze", "args": []}},
    {"lhs": "T_s", "rhs": {"op": "input_T_s", "args": []}},
    {"lhs": "zc", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "column_cell_center", "bindings": {"ze": "ze"}}},
    {"lhs": "dz", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "column_cell_thickness", "bindings": {"ze": "ze"}}},
    {"lhs": "land", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "<", "args": ["xland", "par.land_water_threshold"]}, 1.0, 0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "capg", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["par.capg_per_thc", "thc"]}},
    {"lhs": "exner_air", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exner_function", "bindings": {"p": "p_air", "p0": "wrf.p1000mb", "kappa": "wrf.rcp"}}},
    {"lhs": "theta_air", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "theta_from_temperature", "bindings": {"T": "t_air", "exner": "exner_air"}}},
    {"lhs": "exner_sfc", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exner_function", "bindings": {"p": "psfc", "p0": "wrf.p1000mb", "kappa": "wrf.rcp"}}},
    {"lhs": "theta_g", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "theta_from_temperature", "bindings": {"T": "tsk", "exner": "exner_sfc"}}},
    {"lhs": "upflux", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["radiation", {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "blackbody_emission", "bindings": {"sigma": "wrf.stbolt", "T": "tsk"}}]}},
    {"lhs": "xinet", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["emiss", {"op": "-", "args": ["glw", "upflux"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "rnet", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "net_radiation", "bindings": {"gsw": "gsw", "glw": "glw", "emiss": "emiss", "upflux": "upflux"}}},
    {"lhs": "hm", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["par.hm_coef", "wrf.eomeg", {"op": "-", "args": ["tsk", "tmn"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "psfc_kpa", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["psfc", "par.kpa_per_pa"]}},
    {"lhs": "es_g", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "bolton_saturation_vapor_pressure", "bindings": {"T": "tsk", "svp1": "wrf.svp1", "svp2": "wrf.svp2", "svp3": "wrf.svp3", "svpt0": "wrf.svpt0"}}},
    {"lhs": "qsat_g", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "saturation_mixing_ratio", "bindings": {"ep_2": "wrf.ep_2", "es": "es_g", "p": "psfc_kpa"}}},
    {"lhs": "hfx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "bulk_surface_flux", "bindings": {"coefficient": "flhc", "surface_value": "theta_g", "air_value": "theta_air"}}},
    {"lhs": "qfx", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "bulk_surface_flux", "bindings": {"coefficient": "flqc", "surface_value": "qsat_g", "air_value": "qv_air"}}},
    {"lhs": "lh", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["wrf.xlv", "qfx"]}},
    {"lhs": "qs", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["hfx", "lh"]}},
    {"lhs": "G_sfc", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["rnet", "qs"]}},
    {"lhs": "K_soil", "rhs": {"op": "aggregate", "output_idx": ["kn"], "args": [], "ranges": {"kn": {"from": "lev_nodes"}},
      "expr": {"op": "*", "args": ["par.difsl", "capg"]}}},
    {"lhs": "F_soil", "rhs": {"op": "aggregate", "output_idx": ["kn"], "args": ["K_soil", "T_s", "zc"], "ranges": {"kn": {"from": "lev_nodes"}},
      "expr": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["kn", 1]}, "G_sfc",
                {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["kn", {"op": "+", "args": ["NLEV", 1]}]},
                  {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "index", "args": ["K_soil", "kn"]}, {"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "index", "args": ["T_s", "NLEV"]}, "T_deep"]}]},
                                       {"op": "-", "args": ["z_deep", {"op": "index", "args": ["zc", "NLEV"]}]}]},
                  0.0]}]}}},
    {"lhs": "dTs_dt", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["land", {"op": "/", "args": [
       {"op": "D", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["K_soil", {"op": "D", "args": ["T_s"], "wrt": "lev"}]}, "F_soil"]}], "wrt": "lev"},
       "capg"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "dTsk_dt", "rhs": {"op": "index", "args": ["dTs_dt", 1]}},
    {"lhs": "qsfc", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "==", "args": ["flqc", 0.0]}, "qv_air", {"op": "+", "args": ["qv_air", {"op": "/", "args": ["qfx", "flqc"]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "chklowq", "rhs": "mavail"},
    {"lhs": "snow_cap_active", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["ifsnow", {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["snowc", 0.0]}, {"op": ">", "args": [{"op": "index", "args": ["T_s", 1]}, "par.t_snowmelt"]}]}, 1.0, 0.0]}]}}
   ],
   "tests": [
     {
       "id": "scm_call120_daytime_heating",
       "description": "Reference: WRF 4.8 em_scm_xy single-column run (GNU real32 build, dt = 60 s, mp=6 ra_lw=1 ra_sw=1 sf_sfclay=1 sf_surface=1 (slab, num_soil_layers = 5) bl_pbl=1, data/eqwefic/scm_ref) dumped by the instrumented ctessum-claude/WRF fork (commit e42a269, module_esm_dump hooks in module_sf_slab.F) and replayed through the real64 (-fdefault-real-8) standalone kernels/slab_driver at ESM_DT = 0.01 s. Inputs are the dumped SLAB arguments of tile column 1 (real32 values widened); every expected value is the real64 replay. SLAB1D is an explicit Euler step with nsoil soil sub-steps (nsoil = 2 at dt = 60 s), so its dt = 60 s ground-temperature change is NOT the instantaneous tendency (it differs by 0.4-11 % across the regimes); at dt <= 0.04 s nsoil = 1 and the dumped DTHGDT is the exact derivative at the initial state -- verified bit-identical for dt = 0.04, 0.02, 0.01 and 0.005 s, so no Richardson extrapolation is needed and the 0.01 s replay is used directly. Layer tendencies are asserted against SLAB1D's own arithmetic on the dumped real64 interface fluxes, -(FLUX(L+1)-FLUX(L))/(DZS(L) CAPG), and spot-checked against (TSLB_out - TSLB)/dt. Residual esm-vs-Fortran mismatch comes from the real32 WRF constants handed to the kernel (svpt0 = 273.1499939, svp1 = 0.61119998, ep2 = 0.62175041, rovcp = 0.28571430, stbolt = 5.6705101e-8) versus the nominal values of lib/wrf_constants.esm: measured with zero tolerances over the four regimes it is <= 8.3e-8 relative in theta_air, upflux, xinet, rnet, hm and hfx; 4.6e-7 to 2.6e-6 in qfx, lh, qs and qsfc (the Bolton exponent svp2 (T - svpt0)/(T - svp3) turns the 6.1e-6 K error of svpt0 into 4.2e-7 of es_g, and the saturation deficit qsat_g - qv_air amplifies it, most at night); and the cancellation in G = rnet - qs (|G| << qs by day) and in the layer-1 flux divergence amplifies it further to <= 4.9e-6 in G_sfc and <= 4.8e-5 in dTsk_dt = dTs_dt[1] (call 120: G = -32.6 W/m^2 out of qs = 270; the interior layers stay <= 1.9e-6, <= 1.7e-5 only on the ~1e-8 K/s tendencies of the isothermal regime). Tolerances are set 5-10x above the worst measured residual: rel 1e-6 on the radiative terms and hfx, 2e-5 on the moisture terms, 5e-5 on G_sfc, 5e-4 on dTsk_dt, Linf abs 5e-8 K/s on the tendency column (the layer-1 residual, <= 6.3e-9 K/s) and rel 5e-4 / abs 1e-11 K/s on the per-layer spot checks. Regime: call 120 (step 60, 20:00 UTC = 13:34 LST), midday: gsw = 315 W/m^2, rnet = 237 W/m^2, hfx = 71, lh = 199 W/m^2, G = -32.6 W/m^2 (the surface loses heat to the turbulent fluxes while the soil below is warming from the morning), soil warmer at depth (285.7 -> 288 K).",
       "parameter_overrides": {
         "t_air": 283.92919921875,
         "qv_air": 0.0032298772130161524,
         "p_air": 96827.421875,
         "psfc": 97126.0078125,
         "flhc": 46.444984436035156,
         "flqc": 0.012818618677556515,
         "tsk": 285.68798828125,
         "gsw": 315.13812255859375,
         "glw": 292.805419921875,
         "tmn": 288.0,
         "thc": 0.03999999910593033,
         "emiss": 0.9200000166893005,
         "mavail": 0.6000000238418579,
         "xland": 1.0,
         "snowc": 0.0,
         "radiation": 1.0,
         "ifsnow": 1.0,
         "T_deep": 288.0,
         "z_deep": 0.22999998927116394
       },
       "expression_template_imports": [
         {
           "ref": "./tests/scm_call120_daytime_heating_inputs.esm"
         }
       ],
       "time_span": {
         "start": 0.0,
         "end": 1.0
       },
       "assertions": [
         {
           "variable": "land",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 1.0,
           "tolerance": {
             "abs": 0.0
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "capg",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 2364559.9471479654,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "theta_air",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 286.5566714433966,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "upflux",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 377.73745713208905,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "xinet",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": -78.13747565085322,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "rnet",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 237.00064690774053,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "hm",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": -0.00019894116518699432,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "hfx",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 70.66749182598637,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 1e-06
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "qfx",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 7.95558726523883e-05,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 2e-05
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "lh",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 198.88968163097076,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 2e-05
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "qs",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 269.5571734569571,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 2e-05
           }
         },
         {
           "variable": "qsfc",
           "time": 0.0,
           "expected": 0.009436152214524603,
           "tolerance": {
             "rel": 2e-05
           }
         },
         {
